  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (V. Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Assault Rifles and Sniper Rifles</p>\n<p><em>A precise, high-quality digital sniper scope by Tsunami. The only thing that could bring you closer to your target is a romantic dinner.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Requires Smartgun Link.</strong> Functions as a Sniping Scope. The user can now see detail up to 1,000m/yds away. When making an Aimed Shot or using Take Extra Time for a Non-Aimed Attack on a target beyond 101m/yds, the user gets an additional +1 bonus to the Attack Check. If the target is beyond 201m/yds, they instead get a +2 bonus.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
